<title>ITALY: TABLE - Italian May industrial output rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Italian May industrial output rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following provisional figures for industrial production, year-on-year, in May.</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION		 May 97   Apr 97   May 96</p>
<p> Production index (unadjusted)     114.1   111.9 r   115.3</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct change (unadjusted)	-1.0    +8.1 r   -1.9</p>
<p> Mnth/mnth pct change (adjusted)   +0.3     +0.7     +1.1</p>
<p> Working days in month		  21	 21	 22</p>
<p>Note: (The industrial production index was rebased in January 1994 on 1990 levels, replacing a 1985-based index.)</p>
</text>
